  unitName: Earth Nymph
  unitId: 30130
  unitNumber: 173
  description: A small nymph thought to be born from earth, one of the six elements
    made by the gods. It likes interacting with humans, and will immediately follow
    any traveler it sees. While that's not a serious problem, people perceive it
    as annoying since it relentlessly asks questions when ignored. Despite that,
    many Summoners search it out as it can grant special powers.
  summonDesc: I am an Earth Nymph!<br>You seem interesting...<br>That's it! I'm going
    with you!
